en.text:
Yuumi
“So I read my books more closely than before;
so I treated people more courteously than before.

Yuumi
“At this rate, I am a toy soldier;
at this rate, every day is Sunday.

Yuumi
“I strolled slowly through the sunshine at the shrine,
and smiled whenever I met an acquaintance;

Yuumi
“The moss was cool indeed;
today, a fair day beyond all telling.

Yuumi
“Truly, life is a moment’s dream;
ah, the beauty of a rubber balloon.
